{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.71. `scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species`: the Year twin of `scale-county-start-species` -- the same START-exhaust selections (THC, CH4, N2O, the six ATRatio toxics, NMHC, NMOG, TOG, VOC, Atmospheric CO2, Total Energy, CO2 Equivalent and the PM species) for the gasoline passenger car (21) and the diesel combination long-haul truck (62), over `scale-county-timeagg-year`'s county database, months (January, April, July and October 2020), day types, hours and road types, with `<aggregateBy key=\"Year\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`. MOVESOutput is 3,521 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the start species under PreAggYEAR.sql's month collapse: the start ATRatio FuelEffectsGenerator writes after the collapse over the summed supply (AirToxicsCalculator multiplies the raw shares, conventions §121), the Complex Model's start configurations over the MonthGroupWeighting mean of ATBaseEmissions, N2O's all-starts mode at the one collapsed hour-day, and PM's multiplicative start temperature at the collapsed temperature.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "year-aggregation",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "nox-speciation",
      "so2",
      "co2e"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 0 -- PreAggYEAR.sql's SYNTHESIZED `Whole Year`. The RunSpec selects January, April, July and October (`db_aggregationmonth`).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./selections/scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-month.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE MONTHS THE RUNSPEC SELECTED, monthIDs 1, 4, 7 and 10, read out of the RunSpec XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py` into `runspecs/selections/scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics-month.parquet`: MOVES overwrites the month list with MonthOfAnyYear 0 after PreAggYEAR.sql has collapsed the month tables over these (ExecutionRunSpec.java:424-445). It overrides the default database catalogue's entry, every month of MonthOfAnyYear. The same months and day types as `scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics`, so the same file.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-year-start-species/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Entire Day`. The RunSpec selects all 24 hours.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
