        "note": "7 rows: source type 21 with gasoline, diesel, E85 and electricity, 62 with diesel, CNG and electricity (MOVES adds every fuel the RunSpec does not name).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_movesoutput": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
